          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu muhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA, imwe mwena enkwatwa abu naabingire Yerusaalemu kuza Babulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.14.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 14:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba ahari Ahabu mwene Kolaaya, na Zedekia mwene Maaseya, abarikubahanuurira ebishuba, naagira ati: Reeba, ndyabahayo omu mikono ya Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni, abaitire omu maisho gaanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
