            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Oyeragiire, waatwekyera abantu boona ab'omuri Yerusaalemu ebaruha, na Zefania mwene Maaseya omunyamurwa, n'abanyamurwa boona noogira oti: ",
          "type": "text",
