          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabw'okuba itwe abari omuri Babulooni atutumireho, naagira ati: obukwatwa bwanyu nibwija kumara omwanya muhango; mbwenu mwombekye amaju, mugatuuremu; muhingye emisiri, murye ebi muryezamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.28",
