        },
        {
          "text": " nikyo MUKAMA arikugirira ati: Ndyafubira Shemaaya owa Nehelaamu n'abaijukuru; tarigira n'omwe oritsigara omu ihanga eri orireeba ebirungi ebi ndikorera abantu bangye, ahabw'okuba agambire eby'okungomera; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.",
